 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg5-00",
   "text": "回头看这些事故，攻击者大多没有找到代码 bug。",
   "spoken": "回头看这些事故，攻击者大多没有找到代码 bug。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg5-00.mp3",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 4.2,
   "speechStart": 1.698,
   "speechEnd": 4.971
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-01",
   "text": "他们改变的，是三样东西：顺序，规模，时间。",
   "spoken": "他们改变的，是三样东西：顺序，规模，时间。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg5-01.mp3",
   "start": 6.02,
   "dur": 5.52,
   "speechStart": 6.118,
   "speechEnd": 10.725
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-02",
   "text": "防御也按这三样来设计。",
   "spoken": "防御也按这三样来设计。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg5-02.mp3",
   "start": 11.76,
   "dur": 3.24,
   "speechStart": 11.858,
   "speechEnd": 14.167
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-03",
   "text": "先说顺序。任何会减少抵押品，或者增加债务的路径，都必须在结束时检查健康因子。",
   "spoken": "先说顺序。任何会减少抵押品，或者增加债务的路径，都必须在结束时检查健康因子。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg5-03.mp3",
   "start": 15.22,
   "dur": 8.184,
   "speechStart": 15.318,
   "speechEnd": 22.565
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-04",
   "text": "新增一个函数，就要确认它走了这道检查。Euler 缺的，就是这一步。",
   "spoken": "新增一个函数，就要确认它走了这道检查。Euler 缺的，就是这一步。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg5-04.mp3",
   "start": 23.624,
   "dur": 6.36,
   "speechStart": 23.722,
   "speechEnd": 29.16
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-05",
   "text": "再说规模。低流动性抵押品要有供应上限，自家代币做抵押，要有额外限制。",
   "spoken": "再说规模。低流动性抵押品要有供应上限，自家代币做抵押，要有额外限制。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg5-05.mp3",
   "start": 30.204,
   "dur": 7.632,
   "speechStart": 30.302,
   "speechEnd": 37.014
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-06",
   "text": "清算奖励在极端行情下也要有吸引力，清算折扣要有上限。",
   "spoken": "清算奖励在极端航情下也要有吸引力，清算折扣要有上限。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg5-06.mp3",
   "start": 38.056,
   "dur": 5.64,
   "speechStart": 38.154,
   "speechEnd": 42.844
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-07",
   "text": "铸币要有单笔和每日的累计限额，多人审批，异常时熔断。",
   "spoken": "铸币要有单笔和每日的垒计限额，多人审批，异常时熔断。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg5-07.mp3",
   "start": 43.916,
   "dur": 5.64,
   "speechStart": 44.014,
   "speechEnd": 48.704
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-08",
   "text": "三个签名人里一人就够，等于只有一个签名人。",
   "spoken": "三个签名人里一人就够，等于只有一个签名人。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg5-08.mp3",
   "start": 49.776,
   "dur": 4.536,
   "speechStart": 49.874,
   "speechEnd": 53.481
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-09",
   "text": "抵押品估值，不能只看一家交易所的订单簿。",
   "spoken": "抵押品估值，不能只看一家交易所的订单簿。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg5-09.mp3",
   "start": 54.532,
   "dur": 3.888,
   "speechStart": 54.63,
   "speechEnd": 57.582
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-10",
   "text": "最后是时间。投票权用历史快照，提案执行要过时间锁。",
   "spoken": "最后是时间。投票权用历史快照，提案执行要过时间锁。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg5-10.mp3",
   "start": 58.64,
   "dur": 5.88,
   "speechStart": 58.738,
   "speechEnd": 63.699
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-11",
   "text": "提款和赎回，也可以设延迟。",
   "spoken": "提款和赎回，也可以设延迟。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg5-11.mp3",
   "start": 64.74,
   "dur": 3.312,
   "speechStart": 64.838,
   "speechEnd": 67.219
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-12",
   "text": "2025 年 2 月 Bybit 被盗以后，攻击者尝试赎回 cmETH。",
   "spoken": "2025 年 2 月 Bybit 被盗以后，攻击者尝试赎回 cmETH。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg5-12.mp3",
   "start": 68.272,
   "dur": 5.784,
   "speechStart": 68.37,
   "speechEnd": 73.227
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-13",
   "text": "按 The Block 报道，mETH 协议有 8 小时的提款延迟。",
   "spoken": "按 The Block 报道，mETH 协议有 8 小时的提款延迟。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg5-13.mp3",
   "start": 74.276,
   "dur": 4.752,
   "speechStart": 74.374,
   "speechEnd": 78.183
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-14",
   "text": "团队趁这段时间暂停了合约，追回 15000 枚 cmETH，约 4300 万美元。",
   "spoken": "团队趁这段时间暂停了合约，追回 15000 枚 cmETH，约 4300 万美元。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg5-14.mp3",
   "start": 79.248,
   "dur": 7.032,
   "speechStart": 79.346,
   "speechEnd": 85.441
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-15",
   "text": "延迟把攻击者完成攻击的时间，从一笔交易拉长到几个小时，让监控和人工响应有机会介入。",
   "spoken": "延迟把攻击者完成攻击的时间，从一笔交易拉长到几个小时，让监控和人工响应有机会介入。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg5-15.mp3",
   "start": 86.5,
   "dur": 8.088,
   "speechStart": 86.598,
   "speechEnd": 93.752
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-16",
   "text": "代价是，正常用户也要等。",
   "spoken": "代价是，正常用户也要等。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg5-16.mp3",
   "start": 94.808,
   "dur": 2.904,
   "speechStart": 94.906,
   "speechEnd": 96.882
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-17",
   "text": "所以延迟是一种安全参数，不只是体验问题。",
   "spoken": "所以延迟是一种安全参数，不只是体验问题。",
